    "title": "<p>Diagnostic criteria for malignant melanotic nerve sheath tumour</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "David Emanuel Reuss",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; \" border=\"0\" width=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\"><em style=\"\">Essential:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Fascicular to sheet-like proliferation of variably pigmented, relatively uniform, plump, spindled to epithelioid cells</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\">AND</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 416.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"556\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Coexpression of S100/SOX10 and melanocytic markers (e.g. HMB45, melan-A)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 416.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"556\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\">OR</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 416.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"556\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Loss of PRKAR1A expression, or <em>PRKAR1A</em> mutation</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\">AND (for unresolved lesions)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 416.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"556\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Methylation profile of malignant melanotic nerve sheath tumour</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\"><em style=\"\">Desirable:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"\">Origin from a paraspinal or visceral autonomic nerve</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
